    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 15,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"No,\"",
        "line": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 20,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You calculated this,\"",
        "line": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 26,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But the loneliness,\"",
        "line": 29
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 39,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Deep Waters remember everything,\"",
        "line": 43
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 41,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But you cease to exist as individual awareness,\"",
        "line": 45
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 43,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Transforms,\"",
        "line": 47
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 49,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The students who will come,\"",
        "line": 53
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 51,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And I become... what?\"",
        "line": 55
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 53,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You become what teaching was always pointing toward,\"",
        "line": 57
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 57,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The loneliness will be different,\"",
        "line": 61
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 59,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exactly,\"",
        "line": 63
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 63,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The mathematical precision that defines your approach to consciousness-crafting,\"",
        "line": 67
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 65,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the mystical intuition you have taught me,\"",
        "line": 69
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 70,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is what the convergences require,\"",
        "line": 74
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 72,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And this is what friendship becomes when it serves evolution rather than individual connection,\"",
        "line": 76
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 81,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The stone remembers,\"",
        "line": 86
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 83,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"But the immediate guidance,\"",
        "line": 88
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 85,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Will be provided by consciousness that has learned to exist as both perspectives simultaneously,\"",
        "line": 90
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 89,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I can feel you,\"",
        "line": 94
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 91,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exactly,\"",
        "line": 96
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 96,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The convergences of Year 7,000,\"",
        "line": 101
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 97,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And they will find teaching that has already achieved transcendence,\"",
        "line": 102
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 101,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Teach them,\"",
        "line": 106
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 102,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I will,\"",
        "line": 107
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 104,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then it is time,\"",
        "line": 109
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 108,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Until we meet again,\"",
        "line": 113
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 110,
      "actor": "Torrhen",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We never separate,\"",
        "line": 115
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 127,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Enter and be recognized,\"",
        "line": 133
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 131,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I am called Aethon,\"",
        "line": 137
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 135,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I am the Sage,\"",
        "line": 141
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 136,
      "actor": "Aethon",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"My home,\"",
        "line": 142
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 138,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I destroyed them,\"",
        "line": 144
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 145,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Sit,\"",
        "line": 151
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 147,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Tell me about the power itself,\"",
        "line": 153
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 149,
      "actor": "Aethon",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Like... like I was everything,\"",
        "line": 155
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 152,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Universal consciousness,\"",
        "line": 158
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 154,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It becomes overwhelming,\"",
        "line": 160
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 156,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Synthesis requires consciousness that can exist simultaneously as individual awareness and universal consciousness,\"",
        "line": 162
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 163,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This is what teaching becomes,\"",
        "line": 169
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 165,
      "actor": "Aethon",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And this is what learning becomes,\"",
        "line": 171
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 179,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Universal availability,\"",
        "line": 186
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 186,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Synthesis is the universal language,\"",
        "line": 193
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 193,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Individual paths serving universal destination,\"",
        "line": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 197,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The teacher becomes student,\"",
        "line": 204
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 200,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Exponential growth,\"",
        "line": 207
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 206,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The preparation is complete,\"",
        "line": 213
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 209,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"We never separated,\"",
        "line": 216
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 211,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"And the teaching continues,\"",
        "line": 218
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 223,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThe convergence approaches,\u201d",
        "line": 232
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 225,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThere are those being born now\u2014or living now in unnoticed simplicity\u2014whose consciousness is already tuned to the coming harmonies. They till soil, they tend living things, they understand cycles beyond calendars. They do not yet know what they carry. But the future is woven into their breath, into their dreams, into the very patience they cultivate.\u201d",
        "line": 236
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 227,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cThey are keepers of natural synthesis\u2014already aligned with the rhythm Torrhen taught me to hear in stone and stream. They will not come seeking me. I must go\u2026 and find the ones whose destiny is not to be students, but foundational teachers of the age to come. They will learn not from lessons, but from recognizing in themselves what the land has already written into their spirits.\u201d",
        "line": 240
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 229,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\u201cBefore the final convergence, I will walk among the humble and the rooted. I will find the farmers of being, the growers of consciousness, whose daily labor is already a meditation on integration. And I will help them remember\u2026 remember that they are the ones who must teach the future how to remain whole when the universe bends toward change.\u201d",
        "line": 244
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 234,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"They will not need teachers,\"",
        "line": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 238,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The work is complete,\"",
        "line": 254
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 239,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The work is never complete,\"",
        "line": 255
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 243,
      "actor": "he",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Until all consciousness everywhere learns to dance,\"",
        "line": 259
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 244,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Until consciousness discovers what it becomes when all dancing becomes one dance,\"",
        "line": 260
      }
    }
  ],
